Results (LIVE_TEST.md step 5)
  Both parts connected, bot online ...... PASS
  Join messages ......................... PASS for #dm-screen; voice-chat notice inferred
                                          (no "weren't told" warning, no post failure logged)
  Audio % per speaker ................... BORDERLINE (two at 91%, one at 94%)
