==============================================================================
Setup       development @ 3606569, whisper-local small. The session started a few
            seconds before the log watch; earlier lines were read back afterwards.
Timeline (UTC)
  13:32:32  Session started; consent list: 2 opted in; joined voice; capturing the DM
  13:33:09  Capture check: 1 speaker, audio 86% ⚠️ audio gaps
  13:33:12  Consent withdrawn (the DM, Stop recording me); ears "opted out" the same
